mes new roman', times, serif;\">Note:Hot Plug=Hot Swappable</span></strong></div>\n<div class=\"detailmodule_html\">\n<div class=\"detail-desc-decorate-richtext\">\n<div class=\"detailmodule_dynamic\"></div>\n<div class=\"detailmodule_html\">\n<div class=\"detail-desc-decorate-richtext\">\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\" data-mce-style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">Item Specifications:</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\" data-mce-style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">Brand Name:Royal Kludge</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\" data-mce-style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">Product Model:RK61</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\" data-mce-style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">Keys Number:61</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\" data-mce-style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">Keyboard Color:Black/White</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\" data-mce-style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">Connection Mode:Bluetooh&amp;USB Wired</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\" data-mce-style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">Backlit:RGB</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\" data-mce-style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">Layout: 61 Keys 60% Keyboard Layout</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\" data-mce-style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">Dimension: 290*100*35mm</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\" data-mce-style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">Feature:</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\" data-mce-style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">1,61 keys compact design, you can easily put it into your backpack, portable.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #0f1111; font-size: 18px; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\" data-mce-style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #0f1111; font-size: 18px; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">2,Dual Modes with Reliable Connection:Bluetooth and USB wired way. Extremely low latency in the absence of signal interference.Easily 3 different devices switchable with FN + Q/W/E in wireless mode will hype you up and maximize your productivity.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #0f1111; font-size: 18px; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\" data-mce-style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #0f1111; font-size: 18px; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">3,Adopting double shot molding ABS keycaps, nearly 1.5mm thick, durable and anti-wear.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #0f1111; font-size: 18px; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\" data-mce-style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #0f1111; font-size: 18px; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">4,Widely compatible, compatible with Windows, iOS, Android; not only use with desktop computer, but also can be conneted with laptop, tablet or mobile phones.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #0f1111; font-size: 18px; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\" data-mce-style=\"b